#: src/doctor.rs
msgid "Cette version de Windows n'est pas prise en charge par le pilote Sonar (Windows 10 1809 ou plus récent, 64 bits)."
msgstr "This version of Windows is not supported by the Sonar driver (Windows 10 1809 or later, 64-bit)."

#: src/doctor.rs
msgid "Le pilote Sonar n'est pas installé : lancez Platinum-Setup.exe pour l'installer."
msgstr "The Sonar driver is not installed: run Platinum-Setup.exe to install it."

#: src/doctor.rs
msgid "Les réglages du module audio Sonar manquent : relancez Platinum-Setup.exe pour réparer l'installation."
msgstr "The Sonar audio module's settings are missing: run Platinum-Setup.exe again to repair the installation."

#: src/doctor.rs
msgid "Le moteur d'effets Sonar est introuvable : relancez Platinum-Setup.exe pour réparer l'installation."
msgstr "The Sonar effects engine cannot be found: run Platinum-Setup.exe again to repair the installation."

#: src/doctor.rs
msgid "Le runtime Visual C++ manque : les effets du micro ne peuvent pas démarrer. Relancez Platinum-Setup.exe."
msgstr "The Visual C++ runtime is missing: the microphone effects cannot start. Run Platinum-Setup.exe again."
